@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+# ISSUE-2: APAC October total is off too
+
+`python3 -m meridian report --region apac --month 2026-10` prints `178731321.00 SGD`; finance has 1,787,313.21 SGD.
+September is fine. Fix it, with a regression test.
